          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h2",
           "text": "What Should a Moving Company Logo Communicate?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>A <strong>moving company logo</strong> should communicate reliability, care and efficiency. Customers are trusting you with everything they own, so the logo must look established and professional rather than improvised.</p><p>Common design directions include trucks, arrows that suggest motion, boxes, houses and keys. The strongest mover logos keep these symbols simple so the company name stays the focus on trucks and online listings.</p>",
           "classes": []
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
