         "children": [
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h2",
           "text": "Where Your Moving company Logo Will Appear",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>A moving company logo has to work in the places your customers actually see it. Logo Austin designs with these uses in mind:</p><div><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Placement</th><th scope=\"col\">Design Requirement</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Box trucks and trailers</strong></td><td>Large, legible name and phone-friendly layout</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Moving boxes and tape</strong></td><td>One-color version for low-cost printing</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Uniforms and hats</strong></td><td>Compact icon that embroiders cleanly</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Review sites and Google Business Profile</strong></td><td>Square icon that is clear at thumbnail size</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Estimates and invoices</strong></td><td>Professional wordmark for paperwork</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
           "classes": []
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
