           "level": "h2",
           "text": "Checklist for a Strong Moving company Logo",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<ul><li>Keep the name large; customers read trucks while driving.</li><li>Avoid thin lines that disappear on printed boxes.</li><li>Create a horizontal version for trucks and a stacked version for social media.</li><li>Pick colors that differ from the big national movers in your area.</li><li>Get a one-color file for tape, boxes and stamps.</li></ul>",
