           "t": "text",
           "html": "<ol><li><strong>Share your details.</strong> Business name, services, service area and any colors or symbols you want.</li><li><strong>Receive concepts.</strong> Designers create several original moving company logo concepts, usually within hours.</li><li><strong>Revise.</strong> Adjust fonts, colors, icons and layout until the logo fits your business.</li><li><strong>Get your files.</strong> Approve, pay and receive print, web and vector files with full ownership.</li></ol><p>Also useful: <a href=\"/small-business-logo-design/\">small business logos</a> and <a href=\"/branding/\">branding for trucks and uniforms</a>.</p>",
