          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "Should my moving company logo include a truck?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>A truck icon makes the service obvious, but many movers use arrows, boxes or houses instead so their logo is more distinctive. Logo Austin can show concepts in several directions.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "Can I get a version for moving boxes?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Yes. Logo Austin provides a one-color version suitable for printing on boxes, tape and stamps.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "How much does a moving company logo cost?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>At Logo Austin, a custom moving company logo is priced from $125 to $175. There is no upfront charge; you pay only after approving the final design.</p>",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "heading",
           "level": "h3",
           "text": "How fast can I get my moving company logo?",
           "classes": []
          },
          {
           "t": "text",
           "html": "<p>Logo Austin usually delivers multiple moving company logo concepts the same day. Final files in JPG, PNG, SVG, PDF, AI and EPS follow as soon as you approve a design, with full ownership.</p>",
           "classes": []
          }
         ]
        }
